    <string name="tutorial_step1_title">Calibration ya mafunde a kuwala</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step1_body">Ikani zida za calibration mu sample port, mbali ya calibration ya mafunde a kuwala (gwero la RGB) itayangana ndi foni. Kenako jambulani zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_title">Calibration ya response ya sipekitiramu</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step2_body">Ikani zida za calibration mu sample port, mbali ya calibration ya source (kuwala koyera) itayangana ndi foni. Kenako jambulani zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_title">Kujambula kwa sample</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step3_body">Ikani sample yanu kapena blank mu sample port ndi kujambula zithunzi 1–5.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_capture_title">Thandizo la kujambula</string>
    <string name="tutorial_capture_body">Gwiritsani ntchito Jambulani kuti mujambule zithunzi 1–5 za RAW, kapena lowetsani kuchokera ku Gallery / Mafayilo (DNG). Sungani foni, slit, grating, ISO ndi focus kukhala chimodzimodzi pakati pa zithunzi. Dinani × pa thumbnail kuti muchotse.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_report_title">Thandizo la lipoti</string>
    <string name="tutorial_report_body">Lipoti limasonkhanitsa zotsatira zonse zowerengedwa: Tsamba 1, mapping ya mafunde a kuwala ndi validation ya G; Tsamba 2, response ya sipekitiramu ndi mzere wophatikizidwa; Tsamba 3, area ya sample yokonzedwa ndi blank; Tsamba 4, regression ya kuchuluka. Manambala amasinthidwa okha pambuyo pa batch iliyonse.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_dng_title">Thandizo la kamera ya DNG</string>
    <string name="tutorial_dng_body">Kamera ya RAW yokha: kudina kulikonse kumasunga DNG mu Pictures/FungalSentinel mu gallery yanu. Igwiritseni ntchito kusonkhanitsa zithunzi za umboni kunja kwa pulojekiti.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_history_title">Thandizo la Mbiri</string>
    <string name="tutorial_history_body">Mapulojekiti: dinani pulojekiti yomwe ikupitirira kuti mupitirize pomwe munalekera. Ma tab a Preset: onani, sinthaninso dzina, sinthani kapena fufutani ma calibration osungidwa. Export imapanga fayilo ya ZIP.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_settings_title">Thandizo la Zokonda</string>
    <string name="tutorial_settings_body">Konzani chilankhulo, mafunde a kuwala a positioning, source ya SPD, chivundikiro cha theka la sikirini, njira ya blank ndi chitetezo cha calibration. Kusintha kumagwira ntchito nthawi yomweyo pa mawerengedwe atsopano.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_parameters_title">Thandizo la ma parameter</string>
    <string name="tutorial_parameters_body">Sinthani ma parameter a kujambula: exposure 10–3000 ms, ISO 50–1600, focus 0–5 D (0 = zakutali kwambiri) ndi white balance. Zisungeni chimodzimodzi pa mayeso amodzi.</string>
